msgid "Taichi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Uncle Kaz, you gotta help! I gave Ayako some money, but she's\r\n"
"not giving it back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "I know. I heard you two arguing earlier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Then why won't you do something!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"I am. Go wait in the dining room. All of us are gonna have\r\n"
"a talk about what's going on here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Whaddya mean?"
msgstr "Che vuoi dire?"

msgctxt "136"
msgid "It looks like someone stole the money from Ayako."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Huh? Like, someone here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure yet. That's why I want to have this meeting.\r\n"
"Just wait for me in the dining room, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Yeah, okay..."
msgstr "Sì, ok."

